alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 160% of normal in April to May and 72% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22383 had its driest year in 1987 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
